<title>ZIMBABWE: Tanzania's Mkapa meets Mugabe over Zaire.</title>
<headline>Tanzania's Mkapa meets Mugabe over Zaire.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tanzanian President Benjamin Mkapa met Zimbabwean President Robert Mugabe on Monday for talks on bilateral issues and developments in war-torn Zaire, officials said.</p>
<p>The gave no details, but said Mkapa's one-day visit was part of efforts by African leaders to help find a solution for Zaire where rebels have made big advances in a five-month old guerrilla war aimed at toppling President Mobutu Sese Seko.</p>
</text>
